	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"【2021年春、日本展開開始！！】",
			"• 『三国志』をベースにしたSDガンダムが装いも新たに登場！",
			"• 進化したプロポーションとパーツ分割へのこだわりにより、組み立てただけでSD史上最高峰の色分けを実現。",
			"• 一新された頭身バランスと各所の関節構造により、躍動感あふれるポージングを再現！",
			"• 青龍偃月刀・至極は背面に取り付け可能。フィンファンネル風の懸架状態、片手持ち用の形態、両手持ち用の最大形態に組み替えることもできる。"
		],
		"en": [
			"[Spring 2021, main rollout begins! ! ]",
			"• SDGundam based on “Romance of the Three Kingdoms” has a new look!",
			"• Thanks to the advanced proportions and attention to part division, we have achieved the highest color separation in SD history using just the assembly.",
			"• Reproduce dynamic poses with a completely new head and body balance and joint structure in various places!",
			"• Seiryu Kanto Shigoku can be attached to the back. It can also be rearranged into a fin funnel-like suspended state, a form for one-handed use, and a maximum form for use with both hands."
		]
	},
